{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1292131-lunar-charm-directly-inspired-by-existing-media","id":1292131,"title":"Lunar charm directly inspired by existing media","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-26T06:02:06-08:00","id":1292131,"title":"Lunar charm directly inspired by existing media","content":"I got 'You're Welcome' stuck in my head, and then this just sort of popped in there.<br /> <br /> <b>Festival Induced Forgiveness</b><br /> <b>Cost:</b> 6m; <b>Mins:</b> Manipulation 3, Essence 2<br /> <b>Type:</b> Supplemental<br /> <b>Keywords:</b> Mute, Totemic<br /> <b>Pre-requisite Charms:</b> ???<br /> <br /> Engaging in revelry with even their worst enemies, Lunars can secure alliances over drinks and dancing that seem otherwise impossible to consider- so long as the party continues.<br /> <br /> When taking a Persuade action that leverages an Inspiration in that same scene, the target cannot bring any negative intimacies they possess towards the Lunar or the source of the inspiration to bear until the next scene. Depending on the individual and persuasion in question, this may result in them immediately entering a decision point, or they might grit their teeth, swallow their pride, and accept their new circumstances. And sometimes, a Lunar only needs someone to cooperate for a very short time- say, to gain access to a private vault or chamber, or to 'borrow' someone's boat on a deserted island.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Forgot the Totemic - If the Lunar's spirit shape has a cultural association with revelry or loyalty, she may purchase this as a Wits charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> 